/decrypt.co/?p=367114</guid>           <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/kucoin-kucard-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />                  <category></category>            <category>Business</category>                                   <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/kucoin-kucard-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1079\" width=\"1916\"/>                                      </item>            <item>   <title>What Is Arc? The Stablecoin Blockchain From USDC Issuer Circle</title>   <link>https://decrypt.co/resources/what-is-arc-the-stablecoin-blockchain-from-usdc-issuer-circle</link>   <pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 20:32:07 +0000</pubDate>        <description>Arc is a new layer-1 blockchain developed by USDC issuer Circle, designed specifically for stablecoin-native finance.</description>      <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>           <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=340212</guid>           <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/arc-learn-gID_5-pID_1.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />                  <category>Technology Guides</category>                                   <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/arc-learn-gID_5-pID_1.png\" height=\"900\" width=\"1600\"/>                                      </item>            <item>   <title>Justin Sun-Led Liberland Micronation Awards Ethereum Founder Vitalik Buterin Its Top Honor</title>   <link>https://decrypt.co/368116/justin-sun-liberland-awards-ethereum-founder-vitalik-buterin-top-honor</link>   <pubDate>Sat, 16 May 2026 17:34:01 +0000</pubDate>        <description>The micronation honored Vitalik Buterin during ETH Prague 2026 as it continued promoting blockchain-based governance and digital citizenship.</description>    