{"type":"message","id":"a08e0ab5","parentId":"afe6459d","timestamp":"2026-05-18T07:30:27.596Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I found a likely market-wide BTC drop story already; now I’m checking whether it’s truly shared today across feeds and not a duplicate."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_QmT0O0Kkr1ZtZw5Yg0cuePQn","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport subprocess, sys, xml.etree.ElementTree as ET, html, re\nfeeds = {\n 'CoinDesk':'https://www.coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/',\n 'CoinTelegraph':'https://cointelegraph.com/rss',\n 'Decrypt':'https://decrypt.co/feed',\n 'GoogleNews':'https://news.google.com/rss/search?q=bitcoin+crypto&hl=en-US&gl=US&ceid=US:en'\n}\nns = {'content':'http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/','dc':'http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/','atom':'http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom'}\nfor name,url in feeds.items():\n    print('\\n###',name)\n    xml = subprocess.check_output(['curl','-Ls','--max-time','15',url], text=True)\n    print('bytes', len(xml))\n    root = ET.fromstring(xml)\n    channel = root.find('channel')\n    items = channel.findall('item') if channel is not None else root.findall('.//item')\n    for i,item in enumerate(items[:8]):\n        title = item.findtext('title','').strip()\n        pub = item.findtext('pubDate','').strip()\n        link = item.findtext('link','').strip()\n        desc = item.findtext('description','').strip()\n        desc = re.sub('<[^>]+>',' ',html.unescape(desc))\n        print(f'{i+1}. {pub} | {title} | {link[:120]}')\n        print('   ',desc[:180].replace('\\n',' '))\nPY","workdir":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-researcher","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":40}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","usage":{"input":5077,"output":655,"cacheRead":14464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20196,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779089422912,"responseId":"chatcmpl-Dgmihjv0ruVpdNajHLLGpSwJtiSOI"}}
{"type":"message","id":"a00f7e38","parentId":"a08e0ab5","timestamp":"2026-05-18T07:30:28.958Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_QmT0O0Kkr1ZtZw5Yg0cuePQn","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### CoinDesk\nbytes 31352\n1. Mon, 18 May 2026 07:13:08 +0000 | Crypto security is turning into an AI arms race as agents may overwhelm compliance teams | https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/05/18/crypto-security-is-turning-into-an-ai-arms-race-as-agents-may-overwhelm-complia\n    AI agents and automated payments could reach a scale that crypto monitoring systems built for human-paced markets cannot handle, Elliptic CEO Simone Maini warned.\n2. Mon, 18 May 2026 07:05:20 +0000 | Aave restores ether borrowing limits after $230 million exploit | https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/18/aave-restores-weth-collateral-limits-as-rseth-crisis-enters-recovery-phase\n    The DeFi lending protocol reversed restrictions imposed after April’s $292 million exploit, restoring borrowing capacity across six networks as contagion fears ease.\n3. Mon, 18 May 2026 06:55:50 +0000 | Bitcoin Depot, North America's largest bitcoin ATM operator, files for bankruptcy | https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/18/bitcoin-depot-once-north-america-s-largest-bitcoin-atm-operator-files-for-ba\n    Bitcoin Depot, the largest bitcoin ATM operator in North America and publicly listed on Nasdaq, has filed for Chapter 11 bankruptcy.\n4. Mon, 18 May 2026 06:47:37 +0000 | Iran may be turning the Strait of Hormuz into a bitcoin-based insurance market, local reports say | https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/18/iran-may-be-turning-the-strait-of-hormuz-into-a-bitcoin-insurance-market-loc\n    State-linked Fars News reported that Iran’s economy ministry has been working on a plan to manage shipping through the Strait with payments in bitcoin.\n5. Mon, 18 May 2026 05:47:13 +0000 | Crypto traders betting on a rally lose $563 million in liquidations. Ether and bitcoin suffer the most |